all it is probably very useful to investigate exactly what it is that
Extropian's are interested in uploading in terms of self.  What is cake and
what is icing?  Ego, as our idea of ourselves, is very much a practical
issue.  Ego seems to be at self identification around a core a point
(literally) of view. "Attention" is probably a good word to describe the
