the psyche and it seems to have the ability of identifying with (short or
long term) various things that it (the point of view) "sees".  These
identifications tend to accrete around the core making it less and less
mobile and almost certainly more difficult to upload.  Certainly a very
good understanding of just what it is that we wish to preserve is essential
to deciding just what is the best way to preserve it.

  

